+# Local Cairo compatibility patch (2026-09-29)
+
+Opaque LLVM pointer selects now explicitly convert their operands to the
+resolved MSL result pointee type, preserving the address space. This is covered
+by `cumetal_nvvm_ir_msl_test`; downstream felt252 device parity is recorded by
+the stwo-zig local Cairo CUDA lane. This local patch does not qualify NVIDIA
+execution or a complete Cairo proof.
